{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛和朱敏瀚在台慶夜大展身手，於「極速狂奔Speed and Stunt」環節中表現極亮眼。尤其於綵排時曾於2米高地方摔下的朱敏瀚，在表演環節中，完美演繹由2米躍下的動作，動作相當利落，劉穎鏇亦打得十分精彩，技驚四座！完成演出後，大家輪住感謝特技人的付出，以及多謝今個環節的主舵人錢嘉樂。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.683572+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:42:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:04.461895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:50.459064+00:00","content_hash":"64ecd24209da62b528a300ca808506c324955dcaeea6fab1afaf1749b821bc0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.683572+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}